  "policy": {
    "additions": "analyzer input forms only, appended after the v1.7 forms",
    "canonical_text": "untouched; analysis_forms[0] is the frozen canonical form",
    "carrier_only": "each carrier edit replaces one hamza-family codepoint with another; carrier membership is asserted on every variant",
    "edit_script_and_inverse_checked_on_every_variant": true,
    "frozen_lines_unchanged": "v1.8 imports select-camel-candidate-v1_7 and calls its runner - itself select-camel-candidate-v1_5.main() - with the dump and output directory redirected only. V.TOKEN_MAP_PATH stays on the FROZEN token map so R1-R5 build exactly the variants they built in v1.6 and v1.7. No selector, recall, split, hamza, orthographic or lexicon rule was edited and no rule ordering was changed.",
    "hamza_pass_not_chained": "the frozen R1-R3 rewrite is not applied on top of the carrier variants, so the production pools are exactly what the narrowing round measured",
    "inherited": "every policy of the hamza-carrier-v1, orthographic-production-v1_7, paradigm-gap-v2, v1.6 and v1.5 manifests",
    "no_verse_key_no_surface_allowlist_no_teacher_gate": true,
    "otiose_alef": "only ever inside a script that also carries the carrier edit from the same site, with `bound_to_carrier_at` recorded",
    "production_db": "not written; data/app.db untouched",
    "teacher_use": "evaluation only; the token map builder never opens it"
  },
  "rule_verdict_reasons": {
    "HC1_BARE_AFTER_LONG_ALEF_BEFORE_WAW": "Superseded by the pair above. Its own 29-token figure came from a root-matching, lemma-agnostic criterion; measured as exact lemma+root+POS it reaches only 20, because on word-final surfaces جاؤو analyses as the adjective جَائِي rather than the verb جَاء.",
    "HC1_PLUS_O4_BARE_TO_WAW_SEAT_PLUS_OTIOSE_ALEF": "Accepted. Same site, word-final waw: the carrier substitution and the otiose alef are ONE edit script. 13 trigger tokens corpus-wide, 9 of them in-scope; all 13 convert RECALL_GAP->CORRECT and every selected candidate is exact lemma+root+POS.",
    "HC1a_BARE_TO_WAW_SEAT_BEFORE_AFFIXED_WAW": "Accepted. U+0621 -> U+0624 in one codepoint neighbourhood (unvowelled long alef before, waw after) and only where real affix material follows the waw. 22 trigger tokens corpus-wide, 20 of them in-scope. The added carrier form puts an exact lemma+root+POS candidate into all 20 pools; the FROZEN cascade selects it on the 7 يَشَآءُونَ/تَشَآءُونَ tokens and leaves the 13 جَآءُو + enclitic tokens AMBIGUOUS, where the verb جَاء and the adjective جَائِي are both exact-root and the unchanged cascade declines to choose. No token the frozen v1.7 selection already gets CORRECT receives a competing lexical core; the 13 stay RECALL_GAP->AMBIGUOUS, which costs nothing under any regression gate.",
    "HC2_BARE_AFTER_SUKUN_GLIDE": "REJECTED in the carrier round: closes 2, gives 9 already-CORRECT tokens a competing core.",
    "HC3_BARE_AFTER_LONG_YEH": "REJECTED: closes 3, risks 13.",
    "HC4X_WAW_SEAT_TO_YEH_SEAT": "REJECTED: closes 7, risks 58.",
    "HC5X_YEH_SEAT_TO_ALEF_SEAT": "REJECTED: closes 2, risks 178.",
    "HC6X_WAW_SEAT_TO_ALEF_SEAT": "REJECTED: closes 0, risks 85.",
    "O4X_PLURAL_WAW_OTIOSE_ALEF": "Not revived as a standalone rule and it cannot be: the alef edit has no trigger of its own, is emitted only alongside a carrier edit produced by the same site, records `bound_to_carrier_at`, and `derive()` raises if it ever sees an unbound alef edit."
  },
